下面是一个带重试的调用工具，sleep 被设计为可注入：

```js
async function retry(fn, attempts, delayMs, sleep) {
  let lastError;
  for (let i = 0; i < attempts; i++) {
    try {
      return await fn();
    } catch (err) {
      lastError = err;
      if (i < attempts - 1) await sleep(delayMs);
    }
  }
  throw lastError;
}
```

